error[L0517]: the closure that `counter!` returns cannot change `start`
 --> check/changed_by_returned_closure.knv:6:10
  |
6 |   (fn () (set! start (+ start 1)) start))
  |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this changes the caller's value of `start`
  |
  = note: the closure would keep a `mut` borrow of the caller's value for as long as it lives, so the caller could not read that value again
  = help: to give the closure a value of its own, start `counter!` with `(local count start)` and use `count` in the closure

